<!-- ── Listen-friendly hidden summary ── -->
<div class="listen-friendly-content" style="display:none;" aria-hidden="true">
  <div lang="en">
    <h2>Audio Summary: Tapered Language Models</h2>
    <p>Modern language models — Transformers, state-space models, memory networks — all inherit a silent default: every layer's MLP has the exact same width. This paper asks whether that uniformity should be broken. A simple ablation says yes: on a 440M Transformer, front-loading capacity in early layers beats uniform by 0.32 perplexity points; back-loading hurts by over a point. The authors then measure why — MLP outputs become progressively more aligned with the residual stream (cosine similarity rising from near-zero to 0.5+) as depth increases, meaning later layers are reinforcing content rather than computing new information. Tapering MLP width monotonically from wide-early to narrow-late, under a fixed total parameter budget, directly exploits this asymmetry.</p>
    <p>The best schedule is a smooth cosine decay with a 1.5-to-0.5 ratio, which achieves 14.44 perplexity on the 440M model — 1.84 points below the uniform baseline of 16.28, at zero extra cost. This configuration is then applied unchanged to four architectures (Transformer, Gated Attention, Hope-attention, Titans) at 760M and 1.3B scales. In every single comparison — all eight pairs — the tapered model improves average commonsense reasoning accuracy over its uniform counterpart. The principle transfers across softmax attention, gated attention, recurrent memory, and neural long-term memory. Depth-aware capacity allocation is a simple, architecture-agnostic design lever that has been available since the first Transformer.</p>
  </div>
  <div lang="zh">
    <h2>语音摘要：渐缩语言模型</h2>
    <p>现代语言模型——Transformer、状态空间模型、记忆网络——都继承了一个默认设计：每层MLP的宽度完全相同。这篇论文质疑这种均匀性是否合理。一个简单实验给出答案：在440M Transformer上，将更多参数分配给早期层可将困惑度降低0.32点，而反向分配则会使困惑度上升超过一个点。作者通过测量发现原因：随着深度增加，MLP的输出与残差流的余弦相似度持续上升（从接近零升至0.5以上），说明后期层在强化已有内容，而非计算新信息。将MLP宽度从宽到窄单调渐缩，同时保持总参数预算不变，可以直接利用这一不对称性。</p>
    <p>最优方案是平滑余弦衰减，比例为1.5→0.5，使440M模型的困惑度降至14.44——比均匀基线16.28低1.84点，且无需任何额外成本。这一配置在不修改的情况下推广到四种架构（Transformer、门控注意力、Hope-attention、Titans）的760M和1.3B规模。在所有八对对比实验中，渐缩模型的常识推理平均准确率均优于均匀基线。该原则适用于各种注意力机制和记忆机制。深度感知的容量分配是一个简单、与架构无关的设计自由度，自第一个Transformer起便已存在。</p>
  </div>
</div>

